# smtpd_sender_login_maps — source of truth: deploy/postfix/sender_login.pcre
#
# An authenticated submission client may only use an envelope sender on
# mail.odile.fyi (which is also the only domain OpenDKIM signs). The value is
# the SASL login that owns it. There is one account today; M1 replaces this
# line with one row per tenant.
/^[^@]+@mail\.odile\.fyi$/   odile-test
